+// Where dropped frames come from, logged every five seconds ("OHOS video
+// render"). YouTube's 1080p60 HDR dropped about 30% of its frames on a Mate
+// 70 Pro+ with Render() called steadily at 60 Hz and the upload fast, so
+// this follows each frame from the decoder to the queue:
+// - Render(): calls, the longest gap between them, frames dropped, and how
